{"id":1241,"date":"2015-06-28T22:13:56","date_gmt":"2015-06-29T05:13:56","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=1241"},"modified":"2018-08-15T07:41:56","modified_gmt":"2018-08-15T07:41:56","slug":"the-june-28-2015-roster-has-been-posted","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/06\/28\/the-june-28-2015-roster-has-been-posted\/","title":{"rendered":"The June 28, 2015 Roster has been posted with pictures from the breakfast!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The June 28th CCRA Roster has been posted and can be found below.<\/p>\n<p>150628 CCRA Roster<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s what&#8217;s happening&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>Joe Giovinco changed his call from KC6PTB to N3JAG while Rose Giovinco changed her call from KE6DRH to N4RCG. Congratulation on getting your dream calls.<\/p>\n<p>Michael Atwood, KF6M added his family to the roster. His wife Rae has the callsign of K6RAE (Imagine that!), their son Stephen&#8217;s new callsign is KK6TTZ and their daughter Madison has the callsign of KK6TUA. I hope we hear a lot from them on the repeater.<\/p>\n<p>Our newest member is John Lytle, KD6ZMP from Pleasant Hill. He joined at the breakfast and we are excited to have him aboard.<\/p>\n<p>Last but not least Glen Rickerd, NO6W of Pittsburg rejoined. He has been a long time member and we are glad he is back.<\/p>\n<p>The CCRA is pleased to have so many wonderful members and look forward to seeing everyone at our next breakfast on July 25th at Legends &amp; Heroes Sports Bar at 9 AM. Legends is located at at the Diablo Creek Golf Course at 4050 Port Chicago Highway in North Concord.<\/p>\n<div id=\"attachment_345333\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345333\" data-attachment-id=\"345333\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/06\/28\/the-june-28-2015-roster-has-been-posted\/2015-06-27-09-33-32\/\" data-orig-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?fit=4128%2C2322\" data-orig-size=\"4128,2322\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;2.2&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;SM-N900T&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1435397612&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;4.13&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2015-06-27-09.33.32\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;June 27, 2015 CCRA Breakfast with Vicki, N6KLS leading the meeting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;June 27, 2015 CCRA Breakfast with Vicki, N6KLS leading the meeting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?fit=300%2C169\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?fit=600%2C338\" class=\"size-large wp-image-345333\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?resize=600%2C338\" alt=\"June 27, 2015 CCRA Breakfast with Vicki, N6KLS leading the meeting.\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?resize=1024%2C576 1024w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?resize=300%2C169 300w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?resize=768%2C432 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?w=1200 1200w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-06-27-09.33.32.jpg?w=1800 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><p id=\"caption-attachment-345333\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">June 27, 2015 CCRA Breakfast with Vicki, N6KLS leading the meeting.<\/p><\/div>\n<div id=\"attachment_345334\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"laz